Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 06:23:10 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 021/105] wip(hc): round-4 fused HC kernel (weight prefetch
 above barriers, end-of-kernel t_raw clear, pipelined PB)

Graph-timed microbench on RTX PRO 6000: still parity with the old 3-4 kernel
chain (19.5-24us vs 19.4-22.4us). Kept behind SGLANG_HC_FUSED=1 (default off).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
